   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 523,
   "text": "On Linux, sbx uses $XDG_STATE_HOME/sandboxes/sandboxes/agent-skills when\nXDG_STATE_HOME is set.\nWhen a skill already exists in the store, sbx prompts before replacing it.\nUse --force to replace existing skills without prompts. Importing replaces\nthe complete skill directory rather than merging files. Run the import command\nagain when you want to copy updates from the host. If an import replaces a\n",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
