   }
  },
  {
   "index": 28,
   "tag": "h2",
   "id": "shared-store-behavior",
   "class": "scroll-mt-20 flex items-center gap-2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 21,
   "text": "Shared store behavior",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 1,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 1,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3053,
    "height": 34,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.24,
    "pageFraction": 0.7,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 29,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 254,
   "text": "Running sbx reset clears the shared store.\nSandboxes created for a supported agent mount the shared store read-only by\ndefault. These sandboxes mount the contents of the store each time they start,\nso you can install skills before or after creating them.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3100,
    "height": 132,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.24,
    "pageFraction": 0.71,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 30,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 90,
   "text": "Use --skills with sbx run or sbx create to choose the access mode when\ncreating a sandbox:",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3252,
    "height": 56,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.24,
    "pageFraction": 0.74,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 31,
   "tag": "ul",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 187,
   "text": "readonly: Mount the store so the agent can read skills but cannot modify them.\nreadwrite: Mount the store so the agent can read and modify shared skills.\noff: Omit the shared store mount.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 3,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3328,
    "height": 100,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.24,
    "pageFraction": 0.76,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 32,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 85,
   "text": "For example, create a sandbox without the shared store:\n$ sbx run --skills=off claude",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3448,
    "height": 89,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.24,
    "pageFraction": 0.79,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 33,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 98,
   "text": "To change the default for future sandboxes, set skills.defaultMode to off,\nreadonly, or readwrite:",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3573,
    "height": 56,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.24,
    "pageFraction": 0.82,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 34,
   "tag": "pre",
   "class": "chroma",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 46,
   "text": "$ sbx settings set skills.defaultMode readonly",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3665,
    "height": 25,
    "widthFraction": 0.44,
    "leftFraction": 0.26,
    "pageFraction": 0.84,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 35,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 422,
   "text": "When no mode is specified, the daemon uses skills.defaultMode, whose built-in\nvalue is readonly. An explicit --skills value overrides that default.\nThe mode is applied only when a sandbox is created. Upgrading sbx or changing\nskills.defaultMode leaves existing sandbox mounts unchanged. Remove and\nrecreate a sandbox to change its mode. Sandboxes created without shared skills\nalso need to be recreat",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3726,
    "height": 188,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.24,
    "pageFraction": 0.85,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 36,
   "tag": "blockquote",
   "class": "admonition admonition-warning admonition not-prose",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 419,
   "text": "Warning\nA sandbox with readwrite access can modify skills that other sandboxes load,\nincluding sandboxes with readonly access. Read-only access prevents writes\nfrom that sandbox but does not isolate it from changes to the store. The store\nis dedicated sandbox state, so this does not by itself execute modified skills\non your host. Use --skills=off when creating a sandbox to keep it outside\nthis sha",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 1,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "images": [
    {
     "kind": "svg",
     "alt": "",
     "width": 24,
     "height": 24
    }
   ],
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
